@startuml Email_Register_Login_System_Sequence_Diagram

title System Sequence Diagram: Email Registration and Login Function\n(Administrator and Tourist via Email and OTP Verification)\n(Forgot Password - See separate diagram)

actor "User\n(Tourist/Admin)" as User
participant "UI: Login/Register\nPage" as UI
participant "Email Service\n(Nodemailer)" as Email
participant "OTP Verification\nService" as OTPService
participant "Database\n(MongoDB)" as DB
participant "Authentication\nService" as Auth

== Registration Flow ==

User -> UI: Enter registration details\n(First Name, Last Name,\nEmail, Password)
activate UI

UI -> UI: Validate input\n(email format, password strength,\nterms acceptance)

alt Validation Failed
    UI --> User: Show validation errors
else Validation Success
    UI -> DB: POST /api/auth/register\n{firstName, lastName, email, password}
    activate DB
    
    DB -> DB: Check if email exists
    
    alt Email Already Exists
        DB --> UI: Email already registered
        UI --> User: Show error message
    else Email Available
        DB -> DB: Create pending user record\n(status: pending)
        
        DB -> DB: Generate 6-digit OTP\n(10-minute expiry)
        
        DB --> Email: Trigger OTP email
        activate Email
        Email -> Email: Send OTP to user email
        Email --> User: OTP sent via email
        deactivate Email
        
        DB --> UI: Registration successful,\nOTP sent
        deactivate DB
        
        UI -> UI: Switch to OTP verification step\n(start 10-minute countdown)
        
        UI --> User: Display OTP input form\nwith timer
    end
end

deactivate UI

== OTP Verification (Registration) ==

User -> UI: Enter 6-digit OTP
activate UI

UI -> OTPService: POST /api/auth/verify-otp\n{email, otp}
activate OTPService

OTPService -> DB: Verify OTP and expiry
activate DB

alt OTP Invalid or Expired
    DB --> OTPService: Invalid/Expired OTP
    deactivate DB
    OTPService --> UI: Verification failed
    UI --> User: Show error with\nresend option
else OTP Valid
    DB -> DB: Activate user account\n(status: active)
    
    DB -> Auth: Generate JWT token
    activate Auth
    Auth --> DB: Return token
    deactivate Auth
    
    DB --> OTPService: User activated,\ntoken generated
    deactivate DB
    
    OTPService --> UI: {user, token}
    deactivate OTPService
    
    UI -> UI: Store token and user data\nin localStorage
    
    UI -> UI: Check profile completion\n(birthday, gender, country)
    
    alt Profile Incomplete
        UI --> User: Redirect to\nComplete Profile page
    else Profile Complete
        UI --> User: Redirect to Homepage
    end
end

deactivate UI

== Resend OTP (Registration) ==

User -> UI: Click "Resend OTP"\n(60s cooldown)
activate UI

UI -> Email: POST /api/auth/resend-otp\n{email}
activate Email

Email -> DB: Generate new OTP\n(10-minute expiry)
activate DB
DB --> Email: New OTP generated
deactivate DB

Email -> Email: Send new OTP email
Email --> User: New OTP sent
deactivate Email

Email --> UI: OTP resent successfully
UI -> UI: Reset countdown timer\n(60s cooldown)
UI --> User: Show success message

deactivate UI

== Login Flow (Email/Password) ==

User -> UI: Enter email and password
activate UI

UI -> UI: Validate credentials\n(check if empty)

alt Validation Failed
    UI --> User: Show validation errors
else Validation Success
    UI -> Auth: POST /api/auth/login\n{email, password}
    activate Auth
    
    Auth -> DB: Find user by email
    activate DB
    
    DB --> Auth: Return user record
    deactivate DB
    
    alt User Not Found or Password Incorrect
        Auth --> UI: Invalid credentials
        UI --> User: Show error message
    else Credentials Valid
        Auth -> Auth: Verify account status\n(must be active)
        
        alt Account Not Activated
            Auth --> UI: Account pending verification
            UI --> User: Please verify your email first
        else Account Active
            Auth -> Auth: Compare password hash
            
            alt Password Match
                Auth -> Auth: Generate JWT token
                Auth --> UI: {user, token}
                deactivate Auth
                
                UI -> UI: Store token and user data\nin localStorage
                
                UI -> UI: Check user role and\nprofile completion
                
                alt User is Admin
                    UI --> User: Redirect to Admin Home
                else Profile Incomplete
                    UI --> User: Redirect to\nComplete Profile page
                else Profile Complete
                    UI --> User: Redirect to Homepage
                end
            else Password Mismatch
                Auth --> UI: Invalid credentials
                UI --> User: Show error message
            end
        end
    end
end

deactivate UI

note right of User
  **Key Features:**
  • Email/Password Registration & Login ONLY
  • OTP expires in 10 minutes
  • Resend cooldown: 60 seconds
  • Password requirements: min 8 chars, 
    1 uppercase, 1 number, 1 special char
  • Profile completion check after login
  • Admin/Tourist role-based redirect
  • JWT token stored in localStorage
  • Account must be activated via OTP
    before login is allowed
end note

@enduml
